      "description": "Cash left on the pay-as-you-go accounts. DeepSeek and Moonshot publish a balance directly. MiMo publishes none, so its figure is derived: a balance read from the Xiaomi console, less everything opencode has booked against the provider since \u2014 re-anchor with `usage_exporter.py anchor mimo <usd>` when you top up or it drifts.",
      "gridPos": {
